rent creatures to create your <strong>own unique builds.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Semi-procedural levels</strong>. Pre-designed layouts, with random spawns each time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A <strong>garden</strong> area where you can relax and <strong>plant the loot</strong> collected from the Beyond.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boss fights</strong> at the end of each level.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Pet animals to gain abilities and watch them fight alongside you. Collect different combinations of animals to help you beat down waves of rogue androids.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1973990/0e0bf0a7f09f7760113e92da279368a3f3910099/header.jpg?t=1776122471", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Hell", "Bullet Heaven", "Creature Collector", "Roguelite", "PvE"], "developers": "One More Dream Studios", "publishers": "One More Dream Studios", "release_date": "Apr 13, 2026", "price": "$9.99", "appid": "1973990", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "14 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bDpKDET4vHg", "first_seen": 1776124800.0}